    // and "size" are different Hash keys. The runtime models it as jsSym (abnf/jsrt.go,
    // built by the js_sym extern), which renders as the bare name but compares only
    // against another Symbol - the same split the interpreter's {__sym: true, s} gives.
    // mkSym therefore hands makeConst a marker that the override below lowers.
